### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### 2. List All Tenants
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tenants

### 3. Create New Tenant
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Acme AI Corp",
  "plan": "free"
}

### 4. Record Billable AI Generation (Idempotent)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: req-sample-uuid-001

{
  "tenantId": "0807c145-cb75-4e39-a234-f4c83d68beda",
  "inputTokens": 1000,
  "cachedInputTokens": 500,
  "outputTokens": 200,
  "reasoningTokens": 100
}

### 5. Check Tenant Usage Rollup & Costs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/usage/0807c145-cb75-4e39-a234-f4c83d68beda

### 6. Create Stripe Checkout Session for Pro Upgrade
POST http://localhost:3000/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "0807c145-cb75-4e39-a234-f4c83d68beda"
}
